{"id":"661477","name":"滑嫩鸡蛋羹","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/661477/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"5个"}],"sub":[{"name":"拇指胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中。","img":"images/661477/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"拇指胡萝卜擦成丝。","img":"images/661477/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再焯水15秒捞出过凉。","img":"images/661477/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"淀粉加水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/661477/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋打散加入胡萝卜丝、盐。","img":"images/661477/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入淀粉水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/661477/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入方型模具中，水烧开后将模具放入锅中蒸15分钟（小火蒸)。","img":"images/661477/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品出锅切块装盘，一盘既美观，又营养的鸡蛋羹，老少皆宜。","img":"images/661477/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}